{"citation_group_id":"76ac5100e0d998bef2868b61","citation_text":"8 straipsnio","confidence":1.0,"relation_type":"internal_reference","resolver":"internal_section","source_anchor":"^s-4bdf6aa7e63cd31c37b8776a","source_etar_id":"26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65","source_excerpt":"1. Pakeisti 8 straipsnio pavadinimą ir jį išdėstyti taip: „8 straipsnis. Lytinių ląstelių ir reprodukcinių audinių paėmimas, laikymas ir naudojimas“.","source_link":"[[latest/26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65#^s-4bdf6aa7e63cd31c37b8776a|7 str. 1 dalis]]","source_path":"latest/26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65.md","source_section_id":"4bdf6aa7e63cd31c37b8776a","target_anchor":"^s-2e1d1adcc737f5ac45fa9249","target_etar_id":"26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65","target_link":"[[latest/26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65#^s-2e1d1adcc737f5ac45fa9249|8 straipsnis. 9 straipsnio pakeitimas]]","target_path":"latest/26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65.md","target_section_id":"2e1d1adcc737f5ac45fa9249"}
{"citation_group_id":"cb112b552b90e475a609c51a","citation_text":"šio straipsnio 1 dalyje","confidence":1.0,"relation_type":"internal_reference","resolver":"internal_section","source_anchor":"^s-e4acdb5271c3032827e64cb3","source_etar_id":"26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65","source_excerpt":"2. Informacija, nurodyta šio straipsnio 1 dalyje, prieš pagalbinio apvaisinimo pradžią turi būti pateikta ir raštu, sutuoktiniams (partneriams) užpildant ir pasirašant informuoto paciento sutikimą.","source_link":"[[latest/26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65#^s-e4acdb5271c3032827e64cb3|6 str. 2 dalis]]","source_path":"latest/26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65.md","source_section_id":"e4acdb5271c3032827e64cb3","target_anchor":"^s-32b6ceaeb36884853bcd91cc","target_etar_id":"26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65","target_link":"[[latest/26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65#^s-32b6ceaeb36884853bcd91cc|6 str. 1 dalis]]","target_path":"latest/26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65.md","target_section_id":"32b6ceaeb36884853bcd91cc"}
{"citation_group_id":"ff829e2636dfc6224e73265f","citation_text":"4 straipsnio 1 dalį","confidence":1.0,"relation_type":"internal_reference","resolver":"internal_section","source_anchor":"^s-77ee2af78e990aa80c98df74","source_etar_id":"26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65","source_excerpt":"2. Pakeisti 4 straipsnio 1 dalį ir ją išdėstyti taip: „1. Pagalbinio apvaisinimo paslaugas, vaisingumo išsaugojimo paslaugas ir (ar) lytinių ląstelių banko paslaugas turi teisę teikti tik Lietuvos Respublikoje įsteigti…","source_link":"[[latest/26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65#^s-77ee2af78e990aa80c98df74|4 str. 2 dalis]]","source_path":"latest/26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65.md","source_section_id":"77ee2af78e990aa80c98df74","target_anchor":"^s-3e7f4deb133da41973ebe3cd","target_etar_id":"26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65","target_link":"[[latest/26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65#^s-3e7f4deb133da41973ebe3cd|4 str. 1 dalis]]","target_path":"latest/26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65.md","target_section_id":"3e7f4deb133da41973ebe3cd"}
{"citation_group_id":"a10e0ca15a8e39f303603906","citation_text":"šio straipsnio 2 dalyje","confidence":1.0,"relation_type":"internal_reference","resolver":"internal_section","source_anchor":"^s-244963aa437fcad88fdc607c","source_etar_id":"26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65","source_excerpt":"3. Į šio straipsnio 2 dalyje nurodytą embrionų saugojimo lytinių ląstelių banke terminą įskaičiuojamas ir embrionų saugojimo lytinių ląstelių banke laikas iki šio įstatymo įsigaliojimo.","source_link":"[[latest/26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65#^s-244963aa437fcad88fdc607c|13 str. 3 dalis]]","source_path":"latest/26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65.md","source_section_id":"244963aa437fcad88fdc607c","target_anchor":"^s-66d2dae874965863904a4e47","target_etar_id":"26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65","target_link":"[[latest/26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65#^s-66d2dae874965863904a4e47|13 str. 2 dalis]]","target_path":"latest/26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65.md","target_section_id":"66d2dae874965863904a4e47"}
{"citation_group_id":"2d5e4a41e47feb087fcf5cb0","citation_text":"4 straipsnio","confidence":1.0,"relation_type":"internal_reference","resolver":"internal_section","source_anchor":"^s-3e7f4deb133da41973ebe3cd","source_etar_id":"26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65","source_excerpt":"1. Pakeisti 4 straipsnio pavadinimą ir jį išdėstyti taip: „4 straipsnis. Teisė teikti pagalbinio apvaisinimo, vaisingumo išsaugojimo ir (ar) lytinių ląstelių banko paslaugas“.","source_link":"[[latest/26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65#^s-3e7f4deb133da41973ebe3cd|4 str. 1 dalis]]","source_path":"latest/26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65.md","source_section_id":"3e7f4deb133da41973ebe3cd","target_anchor":"^s-76323825cee0310ab5e393ab","target_etar_id":"26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65","target_link":"[[latest/26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65#^s-76323825cee0310ab5e393ab|4 straipsnis. 4 straipsnio pakeitimas]]","target_path":"latest/26de5df0e30d11ec8d9390588bf2de65.md","target_section_id":"76323825cee0310ab5e393ab"}
